        "html": "<h1 id=\"reading-list\">Reading list</h1>\n<p>Every form of a <code>LINK</code> block.</p>\n<p>One line, with a colon and a URL:</p>\n<p>LINK: <a href=\"https://garden.example/soil\">https://garden.example/soil</a></p>\n<p>One line, without a colon:</p>\n<p>LINK <a href=\"https://garden.example/seeds\">https://garden.example/seeds</a></p>\n<p>One line, with the other keyword:</p>\n<p>LINKS: <a href=\"https://garden.example/bees\">https://garden.example/bees</a></p>\n<p>One line, with the other keyword and without a colon:</p>\n<p>LINKS <a href=\"https://garden.example/ponds\">https://garden.example/ponds</a></p>\n<p>One line, with a Markdown link:</p>\n<p>LINK: <a href=\"https://garden.example/mulch\">A guide to mulch</a></p>\n<p>One line, with a link to a note:</p>\n<p>LINK: <a href=\"/10+Garden/Compost+basics\">Compost basics</a></p>\n<p>One line, with a link to a note and a label:</p>\n<p>LINK: <a href=\"/10+Garden/Rain+barrel\">The barrel</a></p>\n<p>A list, with a URL:</p>\n<p>LINK:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://garden.example/tools\">https://garden.example/tools</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>A list, without a colon, with a link to a note:</p>\n<p>LINK</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/10+Garden/Herb+bed/Thyme\">Thyme</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>A list, with the other keyword and without a colon:</p>\n<p>LINKS</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://garden.example/hedges\">https://garden.example/hedges</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>A list of more than five lines, with every kind of target:</p>\n<p>LINKS:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://garden.example/spring\">https://garden.example/spring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://garden.example/summer\">https://garden.example/summer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://garden.example/autumn\">Autumn jobs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/10+Garden/Frost+dates+explained\">Frost dates explained</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"not-published\">Winter plan (draft)</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://garden.example/winter\">https://garden.example/winter</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"not-published\">Greenhouse alarm code</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>A block where nothing can show, because its only target is on the deny list:</p>\n<p>LINK: <span class=\"not-published\">Greenhouse alarm code</span></p>\n<p>A block where nothing can show, because its only target does not exist:</p>\n<p>LINK</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"not-published\">Seed library rules</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is inside a code block:</p>\n<pre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LINK: https://garden.example/not-a-card</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is inline code: <code>LINK: https://garden.example/inline</code>.</p>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is in a comment:</p>\n<p>%%\nLINK: <a href=\"https://garden.example/comment\">https://garden.example/comment</a>\n%%</p>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is in an HTML comment:</p>\n<!--\nLINK: https://garden.example/html-comment\n-->\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is a saved row of a frozen query:</p>\n<!-- QueryToSerialize: LIST WITHOUT ID \"LINK: \" + url FROM #type/bookmark -->\n<!-- SerializedQuery: LIST WITHOUT ID \"LINK: \" + url FROM #type/bookmark -->\n<p>LINK: <a href=\"https://garden.example/frozen\">https://garden.example/frozen</a></p>\n<!-- SerializedQuery END -->\n"
    },
